      "WFWorkflowActionParameters": {
        "WFCommentActionText": "Health data reader for the Desk Energy Scriptable script. No calculations, clipboard access, file writes, or network calls. Three Health queries read HRV, resting heart rate and today's active calories. Original uncapped heart-metric history is retained. The final Text output is private Health data: do not share or log it. Add Scriptable's Run Script action after Text, select Desk Energy, set Parameter to Text, and leave Run in App OFF. The script uploads only a small summary to your authenticated Cloudflare relay, not these histories. Run once unlocked and verify permissions; test locked-phone automation separately.",
